{"text":"Government propaganda. We witnessed things like which school the president had visited and distributed packets of milk, which church he had attended last Sunday. So my primary source for entertainment and performance, the world of performance became the cassette tapes my cousins dubbed of American television and brought back home. I was enraptured by things like Kids Incorporated, Menudo, different strokes. But the characters I saw, they all had strange accents and lived in a fiery land called America. And in the 90s we got our second TV station and this one aired 95% foreign programming. I watched Rosa Salvaje from Mexico, neighbors from Australia, and East Enders from the UK. So while my imagination grew and my passion for performance expanded, it still was not a reflection of what was realistically possible for me to dream for myself.","words":[{"text":"Government","start":0.72,"end":1.14},{"text":"propaganda","start":1.14,"end":1.74,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":2.9,"end":2.94},{"text":"witnessed","start":2.94,"end":3.24},{"text":"things","start":3.24,"end":3.58},{"text":"like","start":3.58,"end":4.0},{"text":"which","start":4.0,"end":4.4},{"text":"school","start":4.4,"end":4.78},{"text":"the","start":4.78,"end":5.06},{"text":"president","start":5.06,"end":5.28},{"text":"had","start":5.28,"end":5.62},{"text":"visited","start":5.62,"end":6.0},{"text":"and","start":6.0,"end":6.28},{"text":"distributed","start":6.28,"end":6.8},{"text":"packets","start":6.8,"end":8.2},{"text":"of","start":8.2,"end":8.46},{"text":"milk","start":8.46,"end":8.78,"punct":","},{"text":"which","start":9.76,"end":9.94},{"text":"church","start":9.94,"end":10.28},{"text":"he","start":10.28,"end":10.66},{"text":"had","start":10.66,"end":10.92},{"text":"attended","start":10.92,"end":11.34},{"text":"last","start":11.34,"end":11.76},{"text":"Sunday","start":11.76,"end":12.1,"punct":"."},{"text":"So","start":13.1,"end":13.32},{"text":"my","start":13.32,"end":13.88},{"text":"primary",